  "id": "ai.speculative-decoding-cost-bound",
  "title": "推测解码：接受前缀尾和与成本盈亏条件",
  "summary": "单提议接受率为1−TV；一轮输出长度由连续接受事件的尾和决定。只有附加恒定条件接受率和固定验证成本假设才得到几何加速式；树、MTP、batch变化必须重建事件与成本。",
  "aliases": [
    "speculative decoding speedup acceptance rate cost",
    "推测解码 接受率 草稿开销",
    "expected accepted prefix tail sum total variation",
    "correlated acceptance draft verification overhead",
    "tree MTP throughput latency boundary",
    "speculative decoding walltime analysis",
    "推测解码成本模型"
  ],
  "domains": [
    "ai-algorithms",
